  "slug": "bookings",
  "name": "Bookins",
  "shortDescription": "Set availability, share a secure booking link, and manage appointments from one workspace.",
  "description": "Bookins helps African service businesses configure services, set weekly availability, share secure public booking links, manage appointments, and keep contact history together. Guest access is limited to release-pinned booking actions and never exposes the owner workspace.",
  "category": "productivity",
  "version": "0.5.0",
  "releaseType": "minor",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds time off, owner-created and recurring bookings, rescheduling, completed and no-show tracking, private booking notes, client records with notes and tags (new optional Contacts Table), per-service booking links, a share kit with QR code, prefilled WhatsApp, SMS, and email messages that open in the owner's own apps, an Insights page, and an English/French booking page. Google Calendar remains optional (connect, add events, clash flags, guest busy filter). Adds an optional daily agenda email for the owner (off until turned on). New fields on Bookings, Services, and Profiles; new optional Contacts capability. Bookins still does not take payments or email guests.",
  "sourceVersionId": "__LATEST_SAVED_VERSION__",
